rooms_desc ({"As you walk in onto the porch you begin to notice the dark and somber feelprevalent in the air. The house seems to be well kept, but unused. Theshutters closed and the paint smooth and dark. The whole setting instillsthe words DARK and POWER into you. You have one choice now. You may leavein peace or risk having your life changed in unspeakable ways. The choiceis yours, the closed door is to the north.","As you enter you notice first the overwhelming mental pressure fall upon you.This is not a place for those weak of heart and mind. You notice the headsof many a wild beasts adorning the walls. There are holes in the north, east,and west walls that appear to lead nowhere. You could try them, but you feelthis to be unwise. In the northeastern corner you perceive several portraitsdepicting people you assume to be deceased. In the northwestern corner thereis a large statue.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
